  <item>
    <title>Vol.20：过度自省—东亚女性内耗的最大根源</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c4948333591c27be7e6d96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c4948333591c27be7e6d96</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Aug 2024 13:05:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们到底哪做错了？我为何无法承认他人真实的恶意？</span></p><span></span><p><span>归咎于自己不断反省似乎让一切变得可控。</span></p><span></span><p><span>拒绝情绪内耗，学会课题分离。</span></p><span></span><p><span>请自信点，因为过度自省的我、我们早已做得足够好了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>伍尔夫的那句话送给和我们一样的你“我逐渐变得不喜自省，而是喜欢睡觉、偷懒、沉思、阅读以及骑自行车。”：）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本集内容</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">2:53</a> 健康的自省-行为闭环</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">6:26</a> 过度自省：批判角度的非客观陈述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">9:20</a> 什么样的人容易过度自省？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 错误归因：“我为何把我自己置于这种境地”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">13:34</a> 抗拒弱势的过度自省：拒绝受害者角色&amp;负面情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> PUA背后的过度自省：打压-反省-克服模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> “每个人心里都有一个法官”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 过度自省下的情绪内耗：无法课题分离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a>无法承认恶意：归咎于自己让一切变得可控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> 东亚女性的思维定式——过度自省</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期制作：Yiming</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>联系我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微博：@言之无理FM</span></p><span></span><p><span>听众反馈：yanzhiwuli@163.com</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>收听方式</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>欢迎通过小宇宙、苹果播客、网易云音乐、荔枝播客、喜马拉雅关注收听：）</span></p>]]></description>
